The glob view reads a lone CR as a line break too: the line count counts CR-only lines, and a
header comment ends at its CR instead of running into the code.
== args
input
== file input/cr.js escaped
// Header\rfunction a() {}\rfunction b() {}\r\
== file input/cr.json escaped
{\r  "name": "cr",\r  "private": true\r}\r\
== stdout
glob view: input
input/cr.js (3 lines): Header
input/cr.json (4 lines): {name: "cr", private: true}
== stderr
== exit 0
